		text: `New password-style field for the sync key, making it hidden by default instead of plain text.<br>New option to include a secret key when exporting your data.<br>Sync logic (upload/download/connection) was reworked, so behavior around syncing may feel different.<br>The app will now notify you if the sync data on the server is newer than what's on your device.<br>The delete data button now removes data one step earlier, so deletion may feel more immediate/aggressive than before.<br>Buttons are now disabled while an action is processing, preventing accidental double-clicks.<br>Numbers are now displayed with correct formatting across several screens (main data, mastery).<br>Theme color keys and values are now validated, so invalid custom colors get filtered out instead of silently breaking the theme.<br>Orphaned data items are now kept/pruned instead of being deleted outright, reducing risk of unexpected data loss.`,
